`index.js` is a derived work: its adapter shape, skills-directory resolution
and system-prompt bootstrap follow icanfinish11's implementation, reworked to
register the vendored catalog through dsh's own skill registry
(`ctx.skills.register`) instead of delegating to a skill-provider package. See
README "Credits and licence" for the division of authorship.

